# libretranslate
msgid "**Administrator-issued token:** The role mints a Gitea personal access token named ``gitea-mcp`` for the ``administrator`` account with the read-only scope set ``read:repository,read:issue,read:user,read:organization,read:notification``, and persists it in the token store MCP clients read. Every deploy asks the API whether the stored token still authenticates, revokes the stale entry under that name, and re-mints when the API rejects it. The deploy fails if the fresh token is rejected too."
msgstr "**El administrador señaló:** El papel miente a Gitea acceso personal token llamado ``gitea-mcp`` para el ``administrator`` cuenta con el conjunto de sólo lectura ``read:repository,read:issue,read:user,read:organization,read:notification``, y persiste en la token store que leen los clientes de MCP. Cada despliegue pregunta a la API si el token almacenado sigue autenticando, revoca la entrada de estalla bajo ese nombre, y recuerda cuando la API lo rechaza. El despliegue falla si el token fresco es rechazado también."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Administrator-issued token:** The role mints a Gitea personal access token named `gitea-mcp` for the `administrator` account with the read-only scope set `read:repository,read:issue,read:user,read:organization,read:notification`, and persists it in the token store MCP clients read. Every deploy asks the API whether the stored token still authenticates, revokes the stale entry under that name, and re-mints when the API rejects it. The deploy fails if the fresh token is rejected too."
