msgid "**All changed paths under `roles/<role>/...`**: the changed roles become the seed set, and the whitelist is the transitive closure of those seeds expanded upwards over `run_after`, `dependencies`, and shared services. In other words, every role whose prerequisite set as defined by [combined resolver](../../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/combined/resolver.py) contains one of the seeds is included, together with the seeds themselves."
msgstr "**Todos los caminos cambiados bajo `roles/<role>/...`**: los papeles cambiados se convierten en el conjunto de semillas, y la lista blanca es el cierre transitivo de esas semillas expandidas hacia arriba `run_after`, `dependencies`, y servicios compartidos. En otras palabras, cada papel cuyo prerrequisito se define por [resolución combinada](../../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/combined/resolver.py) contiene una de las semillas se incluye, junto con las semillas mismas."

