# libretranslate
msgid "**Bounded ranges:** A tool whose schema declares ``start``, ``end`` and ``step`` has its point count checked against ``result_items`` and is refused with the smallest step that fits, so the upstream never scans a range whose result the adapter would discard."
msgstr "**Gamas delimitadas:** Una herramienta cuyo esquema declara ``start``, ``end`` y ``step`` su cuenta de punto contra ``result_items`` y se niega con el paso más pequeño que cabe, por lo que el río arriba nunca escanea un rango cuyo resultado el adaptador se descartaría."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Bounded ranges:** A tool whose schema declares `start`, `end` and `step` has its point count checked against `result_items` and is refused with the smallest step that fits, so the upstream never scans a range whose result the adapter would discard."
