# libretranslate
msgid "**Guest MCP probe:** A Playwright spec asserts that an unauthenticated request to the MCP endpoint is never answered with a 2xx."
msgstr "**Sonda MCP invitada:** Una espectro Playwright afirma que una solicitud no realizada al punto final del MCP nunca es contestada con un 2xx."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Guest smoke test:** A Playwright spec asserts that the UI answers behind the proxy and gates unauthenticated visitors: it expects the handover to Keycloak when SSO is on and the UI's own password form when it is off."
msgstr "**Prueba de humo de los huéspedes:** Una espectro Playwright afirma que la UI responde detrás del proxy y las puertas de visitantes no autenticados: espera la entrega a Keycloak cuando SSO está encendida y el propio formulario de contraseña de la UI cuando está apagado."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Guest smoke test:** A Playwright spec asserts that the UI answers behind the proxy and gates unauthenticated visitors: it expects the handover to Keycloak when SSO is on and the UI’s own password form when it is off."
