# libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory folders.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) calls [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), which creates one folder per round at `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (or just `<inventory-dir>` when there is a single round). For each folder, `build_dev_inventory` resolves the round's per-app variant payload and bakes it into the inventory's `host_vars` as `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` overrides. The inventory is therefore variant-resolved on disk; no runtime selector is needed."
msgstr "**Carpetas de inventario.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) llamadas [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), que crea una carpeta por ronda `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (o simplemente `<inventory-dir>` cuando hay una sola ronda)Para cada carpeta, `build_dev_inventory` resuelve la carga útil de la variante de la ronda y la hornea en el inventario `host_vars` como `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` anula. Por lo tanto, el inventario se resuelve con variantes en disco; no se necesita ningún selector de tiempo de ejecución."

