# libretranslate
msgid "**Network bridges are addons.** Appservice / network bridges (e.g. the Matrix `mautrix` bridges to WhatsApp, Telegram, Signal, Slack, Facebook, Instagram) are addons declared under `meta/addons/` with `mechanism: bridge`, one file per bridged network. Each bridge owns its credentials in [`meta/secrets.yml`](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) and is `required: false` and disabled by default. The role's former bridge declarations (e.g. `web-app-matrix`'s `vars/bridges.yml`) are absorbed into `meta/addons/`."
msgstr "**Los puentes de red son addons.** puentes de servicio / red (por ejemplo la Matriz `mautrix` puentes a WhatsApp, Telegram, Signal, Slack, Facebook, Instagram) son addons declared under `meta/addons/` con `mechanism: bridge`, un archivo por red puenteada. Cada puente posee sus credenciales en [`meta/secrets.yml`](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) y es `required: false` y discapacitados por defecto. Las declaraciones de puente anteriores del papel (Por ejemplo. `web-app-matrix`'s `vars/bridges.yml`) se absorben en `meta/addons/`."

