# libretranslate
msgid "**Remote providers:** OpenAI, Anthropic and OpenRouter each add their models when a key is configured. The keys are declared in ``meta/secrets.yml`` with the ``type`` and ``regex`` their value must satisfy, and default to the central ``API.<provider>.api_key`` entry; an unset key leaves that provider’s routes unpublished."
msgstr "**Proveedores remotos:** OpenAI, Anthropic y OpenRouter añaden sus modelos cuando se configura una clave. Las llaves se declaran en ``meta/secrets.yml`` con el ``type`` y ``regex`` su valor debe satisfacer, y por defecto a la central ``API.<provider>.api_key`` entrada; una clave inestable deja que las rutas del proveedor no sean publicadas."

