msgid "Assuming every job burns its full timeout is deliberately pessimistic — no job can outlast it — so the estimate can only overshoot the real drain time. With the current constants that is 4 waves of 20 runners, so 80 rows per chunk, and the last job of a chunk starts around t=18h, well inside the 24h window."
msgstr "Assuming every job burns its full timeout is deliberately pessimistic — no job can outlast — so the estimate can only overshoot the real drain time. Con las constantes actuales que es 4 olas de 20 corredores, así que 80 filas por pedazo, y el último trabajo de un pedazo comienza alrededor de t=18h, bien dentro del 24h ventana."

