msgstr "Editar `roles/<application_id>/meta/variants.yml` (crear el archivo si ausente)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Edit `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. You MUST NOT hand-edit the staged copy under `TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR/<role>/tests/`; the rerunner overwrites it from the repo on each run."
msgstr "Editar `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. NO DEBE entregar la copia escenificada bajo `TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR/<role>/tests/`; el rerunner lo sobrescribe desde el repo en cada carrera."

