# libretranslate
msgid "Email integration in v1: **outbound SMTP only**. When `web-app-mailu` is in `group_names`, Frappe's outbound Email Account is auto-configured against the central SMTP endpoint so notification / password-reset emails leave the box. **IMAP inbound (mail-to-Communication) is deferred to a follow-up requirement.** Rationale: the survey found no precedent in this repo for auto-provisioning role-owned mailboxes in Mailu, so the inbound side requires a new generic Mailu mechanism that is out of scope for this PR."
msgstr "Integración de correo electrónico en v1: **SMTP de salida sólo**. Cuando `web-app-mailu` está dentro. `group_names`, La cuenta de correo electrónico de Frappe está autoconfigurada contra el punto final central SMTP por lo que la notificación / los correos electrónicos de confirmación de la contraseña salen de la caja. **IMAP inbound (correo a comunicación) se aplaza a un requisito de seguimiento.** Rationale: the survey found no precedente in this repo for auto-provisioning role-owned mailboxes in Mailu, so the inbound side requires a new generic Mailu mechanism that is out of scope for this PR."

