msgid "If unhealthy or failed containers are detected, the configured failure notifier (via ``sys-ctl-alm-compose``) is triggered."
msgstr "Si se detectan contenedores insalubres o fallidos, el notificador de fallo configurado (via ``sys-ctl-alm-compose``) se activa."

# libretranslate
