# libretranslate
msgid "On Windows, use [WSL2](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/about) as the development environment and run the repository commands inside WSL2, not directly in [PowerShell](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/). Use Ubuntu 24.04 with [Docker Desktop WSL2 integration](https://docs.docker.com/desktop/features/wsl/), enable [`systemd`](https://systemd.io/), and expect a few Windows-specific follow-up steps around [certificate authority (CA)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Certificate_authority) trust and local name resolution."
msgstr "En Windows, uso [WSL2](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/about) como el entorno de desarrollo y ejecutar los comandos del repositorio dentro de WSL2, no directamente en [PowerShell](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/). Uso de Ubuntu 24.04 con [Docker Desktop WSL2 integración](https://docs.docker.com/desktop/features/wsl/), habilita [`systemd`](https://systemd.io/), y esperar algunos pasos de seguimiento específicos de Windows alrededor [certificado (CA)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Certificate_authority) confianza y resolución de nombres locales."

