msgstr "Leer [default.env](../../default.env) en `(values, comments)` tuples."

# libretranslate
msgid "Read [reset/README.md](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/reset/README.md), [purge/README.md](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/README.md), or [exec/README.md](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/exec/README.md) before using the matching helper."
msgstr "Leer [reset/README.md](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/reset/README.md), [purge/README.md](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/README.md), o [exec/README.md](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/exec/README.md) antes de usar el ayudante."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Read `${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/roundtrip-<app>-<mode>.log` to see which app and mode failed, and the first error."
msgstr "Leer `${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/roundtrip-<app>-<mode>.log` ver qué aplicación y modo falló, y el primer error."

